      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMADA VILLMA (2) finished third last start, beaten 6 metres at Swan Hill over 1750m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. It doesn't get any easier but she is capable of a big performance. MISS ADELIA (1) opened her career in pleasing fashion a week ago, finishing second and beaten 9 metres over 1785m at Stawell. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Her last-start form is good enough to put her right in the finish. EVIE KATE (4) is at the track for the first time. By Sweet Lou and hails from the John Tormey stable. Was not far away in a recent trial and will be ready to run a big race. CAPTAIN MILO (7) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 2190m at Shepparton last time out.",
